From: Taoufik Mouadab <27153304+TaoufikGFX@users.noreply.github.com>
Subject: [PATCH 0004] Qt interface: VLC Neon UI, seek previews, PiP, speed/repeat/boost menus

Neon icon and Inter typography, seek-bar thumbnail previews, separate-window
Picture-in-Picture (Wayland), speed presets, repeat counts (1-5, unlimited),
volume boost up to 300 %, resume prompt and per-file settings, video info panel,
3-second skip buttons, extended default toolbar. Includes the opt-in
integration test harness (reborn/tests) that is compiled into the Qt module.

Applies on top of VLC upstream commit e77e49b5dff7484dbf70cd1540a6a568e1890280.
SPDX-License-Identifier: GPL-2.0-or-later
